{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stellarcraft</strong> is a <strong>sci-fi tower defense game</strong> where you explore different planets, gather resources, and complete missions. Build and upgrade defensive structures to fend off enemy waves and develop your character. <strong>Strategic planning and technological upgrades are the key to success.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>solo or in co-op mode with up to 4 players</strong> and face the challenges of the universe together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Abtrenner.png?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF2.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different planets with unique biomes and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each planet offers different resources and enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your exploration to find strategic positions for your defenses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Abtrenner.png?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF3.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources such as minerals, energy and rare metals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources are crucial for building and upgrading defenses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Certain planets have special resources that are needed to produce advanced technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Abtrenner.png?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF5.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build different towers and defenses to defend yourself against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each tower has unique abilities and upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your defenses strategically to maximize efficiency and conserve resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF4.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your turrets by crafting enhancements and equipping them to your turret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This grants them shields, more ammunition, or extra abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Little Bob","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/661c244db7aade1c7d5ebf2ac4d079e5cfb58526.jpg"},{"name":"What is this hologram?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/091b294c6e9c163d1404d072dbc1d383d4a6906a.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level 1!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/c0787e909c5ec0ad3938ff1675d635aee229e3b2.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level 2!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/84eb489cb8c9661dc34582ef4da09191177578c2.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level 3!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/2b6a70905d3b23bbb0eeb510225e3a86432e4e31.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial finished!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/dbbd0b3d33e9d5cb43c576875fb904e2f2fc5180.jpg"},{"name":"All relics found!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/99a715c72d871783dadbe36acb4e0691c3c6436b.jpg"},{"name":"Well, that didn't go as planned...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/3eb4b2084c3586ac87c986d0d373390d8220d6af.jpg"},{"name":"Complete a level 10 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/fbfef2a072228dec5ab1c18dcc931d10b952cd94.jpg"},{"name":"We are rich!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189820/90f5ec5a862bfbcfac923ccdb0f545dc19dd2ae2.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3189820?t=1744746762","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744746762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/0e8c44224550931a8151fb836e402b4d288be16c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744746762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/0e8c44224550931a8151fb836e402b4d288be16c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744746762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stellarcraft</strong> is a <strong>sci-fi tower defense game</strong> where you explore different planets, gather resources, and complete missions. Build and upgrade defensive structures to fend off enemy waves and develop your character. <strong>Strategic planning and technological upgrades are the key to success.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>solo or in co-op mode with up to 4 players</strong> and face the challenges of the universe together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Abtrenner.png?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF2.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different planets with unique biomes and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each planet offers different resources and enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your exploration to find strategic positions for your defenses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Abtrenner.png?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF3.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources such as minerals, energy and rare metals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources are crucial for building and upgrading defenses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Certain planets have special resources that are needed to produce advanced technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Abtrenner.png?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF5.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build different towers and defenses to defend yourself against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each tower has unique abilities and upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your defenses strategically to maximize efficiency and conserve resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/extras/Stellarcraft_GIF4.gif?t=1744746762\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your turrets by crafting enhancements and equipping them to your turret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This grants them shields, more ammunition, or extra abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["DreamStudios","Sandstorm in a Bottle"],"dlc":[3564830],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189820/header.jpg?t=1744746762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257077189,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077189/movie480.mp4?t=1732732843","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077189/movie_max.mp4?t=1732732843"},"name":"Update Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257077189/3883a35a5950d38dd61fe9cc0fbf4859dd4b38b1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1732732843","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077189/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1732732843","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077189/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1732732843"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257061597,"mp4":{"480":"http://vi